  "content": "\n\n<p>使 Minecraft 指南针指向正北。</p>\n<h2>功能特性</h2>\n<p>修改了原版指南针的逻辑，使其始终指向正北，而不是指向你的重生点。</p>\n<h2>源代码</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/LXGaming/NorthernCompass/\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></p>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>NorthernCompass 采用 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache 2.0</a>&nbsp;许可证授权。</p>\n<p>您可以将此模组包含在您的整合包中。</p>",
